OL,3,GNEWSABank cash machines ripped out in
OL,4,Aovernight raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo cash machines have been ripped out
OL,7,Fof the walls of a bank in southern
OL,8,FScotland in an overnight raid.
OL,10,FPeebles High Street has been closed to
OL,11,Fvehicles after the Royal Bank of
OL,12,FScotland branch was targeted.
OL,14,FA telescopic forklift was left
OL,15,Fabandoned in the street and Borders
OL,16,FBuses has said it will not be able to
OL,17,Fserve the nearby Eastgate bus stop
OL,18,Funtil further notice.
OL,20,FPolice Scotland has been approached for
OL,21,Fa statement.
